# API KEY NO LONGER STORED IN FRONTEND
# 
# This project uses a secure Vercel backend proxy.
# The OpenWeatherMap API key is stored in Vercel environment variables.
# 
# Backend: https://weather-backend-two-psi.vercel.app
# Repository: https://github.com/prabashvijayanga/weather-backend
#
# No .env file needed for this frontend!
#
# If you fork this project and want to use your own backend,
# update the API_BASE_URL in src/services/weatherService.js